values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'psychology-of-endless-scrolling', 'The Psychology of Why You Can''t Stop Scrolling', 'Variable rewards, explained without the lecture', 'science-psychology', 'English', 'YouTube Long-form', 12, 1720, 599, 5999, false, 'From Skinner''s pigeons to the pull-to-refresh gesture, this script unpacks variable reward schedules and why feeds feel impossible to put down. Built with a mid-video retention hook and a practical, non-preachy ending.', '## [00:00] HOOK
(VISUAL: thumb flicking up a phone screen, sped up)
