values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012', 'reels-pack-space-facts', 'Reels Pack: 10 Space Facts in 30 Seconds', 'Ten ready-to-shoot vertical scripts', 'interesting-facts', 'English', 'Reels / Shorts', 0.5, 900, 299, 2499, true, 'Ten 30-second scripts, each with a 2-second scroll-stopping hook, one fact and a loopable last line. Includes on-screen text suggestions for every reel.', '## REEL 1: THE DAY THAT''S LONGER THAN A YEAR
(ON-SCREEN TEXT: "This planet breaks the rules")
HOOK: There''s a planet where a day is longer than a year.
Venus spins so slowly that one rotation takes about 243 Earth days. But it orbits the Sun in about 225.
