insert into public.script_contents (script_id, body) values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012', '## REEL 1: THE DAY THAT''S LONGER THAN A YEAR
(ON-SCREEN TEXT: "This planet breaks the rules")
HOOK: There''s a planet where a day is longer than a year.
Venus spins so slowly that one rotation takes about 243 Earth days. But it orbits the Sun in about 225.
So on Venus, your birthday comes before tomorrow does.
LOOP LINE: And it spins backwards too. Watch again.

## REEL 2: A SPOON OF NEUTRON STAR
HOOK: A teaspoon of this would weigh about a billion tonnes.
Neutron stars are so dense that a teaspoon of their material would weigh roughly as much as a mountain.
LOOP LINE: Don''t drop it.

## REEL 3: FOOTPRINTS THAT LAST
HOOK: Neil Armstrong''s footprints are probably still on the Moon.
No wind, no rain. They could last for a very long time.
LOOP LINE: Unless someone steps on them.

## REEL 4: SUNLIGHT IS OLD
HOOK: The sunlight hitting you is about eight minutes old.
LOOP LINE: You''re always seeing the past.

## REELS 5-10
Mars sunsets are blue · Saturn could float (on paper) · Space is silent · Jupiter''s Great Red Spot · Olympus Mons · The ISS sees 16 sunrises a day.
(Each delivered with hook, body, loop line and on-screen text.)') on conflict (script_id) do update set body = excluded.body;
