insert into public.script_contents (script_id, body) values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014', '## [00:00] COLD OPEN
(VISUAL: office lobby sign: "HUMAN BODY PVT. LTD. Est. at birth")
Welcome to Human Body Private Limited. Thirty-seven trillion employees. No weekends. No holidays. Terrible management.
Let''s meet the team.

## [00:20] THE CEO
(VISUAL: brain in a tie, sweating at a desk)
This is the brain. The CEO. Uses about twenty percent of the company''s energy budget while making up around two percent of its body weight.

## [01:20] HR: THE IMMUNE SYSTEM
(VISUAL: security guard tackling pollen)
Security is great at stopping intruders. Also tackles pollen like it''s an armed robbery. That''s allergies.

## [02:40] THE APPENDIX
(VISUAL: tiny desk in a corner)
Nobody''s sure what this employee does. Recent research suggests it may store helpful gut bacteria. Occasionally it explodes.

## [04:00] THE STOMACH
Works with acid strong enough to dissolve metal over time, and replaces its own lining frequently so it doesn''t digest itself.

## [05:30] THE LIVER
The overworked employee who does five hundred jobs and can regenerate. Treat the liver well.

## [07:00] THE SLEEP DEPARTMENT
Night shift cleaning crew. Skip it and the whole office gets sloppy.

## [08:15] OUTRO
Badly managed? Maybe. But it''s the only company you''ll ever own outright. Look after it.') on conflict (script_id) do update set body = excluded.body;
