values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', 'chernobyl-the-first-36-hours', 'Chernobyl: The First 36 Hours', 'A minute-by-minute documentary script', 'documentary', 'English', 'Documentary', 18, 2560, 899, 8999, true, 'From the 1:23 a.m. explosion on 26 April 1986 to the evacuation of Pripyat the next afternoon. Structured in acts, with narration, archival-footage cues and interview-placement notes.', '## ACT I: [00:00] 1:23 A.M.
(VISUAL: slow drift across a dark control room, dials glowing)
At 1:23 in the morning on the 26th of April, 1986, the night shift at Reactor Number Four of the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant began a safety test.
