insert into public.script_contents (script_id, body) values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015', '## ACT I: [00:00] 1:23 A.M.
(VISUAL: slow drift across a dark control room, dials glowing)
At 1:23 in the morning on the 26th of April, 1986, the night shift at Reactor Number Four of the Chernobyl Nuclear Power Plant began a safety test.
Within about a minute, the reactor was destroyed.

(VISUAL: wide shot of a burning building, distant)
Thirty-six hours later, a city of nearly fifty thousand people would be told to pack for three days. Most of them never went back.

## ACT I (cont.): THE TEST
(VISUAL: archival-style control panel)
The test was meant to check whether turbines could power cooling pumps during a blackout. Reactor power had dropped too low and operators made a series of decisions that left it unstable.

## ACT II: [04:00] FIRE ON THE ROOF
(VISUAL: firefighters, no protective gear)
Firefighters arrived within minutes. Many had no idea they were facing intense radiation.

## ACT II: [08:00] PRIPYAT WAKES UP
(VISUAL: an ordinary Saturday: weddings, children playing)
On the 26th, life in Pripyat continued almost normally.

## ACT III: [12:00] THE EVACUATION
(VISUAL: lines of buses)
On the afternoon of 27 April, around a thousand buses arrived. Residents were told they would return in a few days.

## ACT III: [15:00] THE WORLD FINDS OUT
(VISUAL: Swedish monitoring station)
Radiation detected at a nuclear plant in Sweden helped force public acknowledgement.

## EPILOGUE: [17:00]
(VISUAL: abandoned Ferris wheel)
Thirty-six hours. A city emptied. A word that became a warning.') on conflict (script_id) do update set body = excluded.body;
