values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017', 'reels-pack-psychology-hooks', 'Reels Pack: 10 Psychology Hooks', 'Hinglish shorts that stop the scroll', 'science-psychology', 'Hinglish', 'Reels / Shorts', 0.75, 1050, 299, 2499, true, 'Ten 45-second Hinglish reels on everyday psychology: the spotlight effect, the Zeigarnik effect and more. Every reel ships with a hook, a body, a CTA and caption text.', '## REEL 1: SPOTLIGHT EFFECT
