insert into public.script_contents (script_id, body) values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017', '## REEL 1: SPOTLIGHT EFFECT
(ON-SCREEN TEXT: "Sab aapko nahi dekh rahe")
HOOK: Aapko lagta hai sab log aapko notice kar rahe hain? Sach bataun? Bilkul nahi.
Psychology mein isse kehte hain Spotlight Effect. Ek study mein students ko ek awkward t-shirt pehna kar class mein bheja gaya. Unhe laga aadhi class ne notice kiya. Asal mein? Bahut kam logon ne.
CTA: Follow karo, kal ek aur dimaag ka secret.

## REEL 2: ZEIGARNIK EFFECT
HOOK: Adhoora kaam dimaag se kyun nahi nikalta?
Dimaag incomplete tasks ko zyada yaad rakhta hai. Isliye cliffhanger kaam karte hain.
CTA: Part 2 kal. (Dekha? Kaam kar gaya.)

## REEL 3: MERE EXPOSURE EFFECT
HOOK: Jo gaana pehle bekaar laga, ab favourite kyun hai?
Baar baar sunne se dimaag familiar cheez ko pasand karne lagta hai.

## REEL 4: DECISION FATIGUE
HOOK: Raat ko junk food zyada kyun khaate ho?
Din bhar decisions lete lete willpower thak jaata hai.

## REELS 5-10
Pratfall effect · Ben Franklin effect · Peak-end rule · Choice overload · Foot-in-the-door · The IKEA effect
(Each delivered with hook, body, CTA and caption.)') on conflict (script_id) do update set body = excluded.body;
