values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018', 'reels-pack-history-in-60-seconds', 'Reels Pack: History in 60 Seconds', 'Ten one-minute history shorts', 'history', 'English', 'Reels / Shorts', 1, 1400, 349, 2999, true, 'The shortest war in history, the emperor who lost to rabbits, and eight more. Ten fast, accurate one-minute scripts with punchy endings built for re-watches.', '## REEL 1: THE SHORTEST WAR EVER
