insert into public.script_contents (script_id, body) values ('5c1a0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018', '## REEL 1: THE SHORTEST WAR EVER
(ON-SCREEN TEXT: "This war lasted less than an hour")
HOOK: The shortest war in recorded history lasted under forty-five minutes.
In August 1896, Britain and the Sultanate of Zanzibar went to war after a disputed succession. British ships opened fire in the morning. By the time many people had finished breakfast, it was over.
LOOP LINE: Shorter than this playlist. Keep watching.

## REEL 2: NAPOLEON VS THE RABBITS
HOOK: Napoleon was once defeated by rabbits.
A celebratory rabbit hunt reportedly went wrong when the tame rabbits charged the guests instead of fleeing.
LOOP LINE: History''s least expected ambush.

## REEL 3: THE GREAT EMU WAR
HOOK: In 1932, Australia fought emus. The emus did well.
Soldiers with machine guns were sent to cull emus damaging crops. The birds proved very hard to catch.

## REEL 4: CLEOPATRA AND THE PYRAMIDS
HOOK: Cleopatra is closer to us in time than to the pyramids'' builders.

## REELS 5-10
The dancing plague of 1518 · London''s beer flood · The Library of Ashurbanipal · Nalanda · The year 1816 without a summer · The first email.
(Each delivered with hook, body and loop line.)') on conflict (script_id) do update set body = excluded.body;
